/-!
# The truncated cuboctahedron

The polyhedron `Archimedean.TruncatedCuboctahedron.polyhedron`: the convex hull of 48 points.
-/

namespace Nieuwland.Archimedean.TruncatedCuboctahedron

open Classical in
